def page(title,body,sub=''):
 return f'''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{title} · Zhu Hong</title><meta name="description" content="π 100 — 逐位练习圆周率，复习错题，挑战完美 100 位。A native pi memory challenge by Zhu Hong."><link rel="icon" href="/pi100/icon.png"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/pi100/style.css"></head><body><header><a href="/pi100/" aria-label="π 100 首页">π 100</a><nav><a href="/pi100/support/">支持 Support</a><a href="/pi100/privacy/">隐私 Privacy</a><a href="/">Zhu Hong</a></nav></header><main>{body}</main><footer>© 2026 Zhu Hong · <a href="mailto:zivzhu@gmail.com">zivzhu@gmail.com</a></footer></body></html>'''
(out/'index.html').write_text(page('π 100 · 圆周率记忆挑战','''<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE DIGIT AT A TIME</span><h1>让记忆，<br>无限延伸。</h1><p class="lead">一百位圆周率，从第一位开始。用专注的练习，把陌生的数字变成记忆里的节奏。</p><p class="en" lang="en">One hundred digits. A little further, every day.</p><span class="badge">iOS 原生应用 · 准备上架</span></div><img src="/pi100/icon.png" alt="π 100 应用图标" width="220" height="220"></section><section class="steps"><article><span class="number">01</span><h2>逐位练习</h2><p>每行十位，循序渐进。卡住时可使用提示，提示过的位置单独记录。</p><p class="en" lang="en">Practice with optional hints.</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h2>只复习难点</h2><p>答错和提示过的位置自动整理成复习，让每一轮都有明确的方向。</p><p class="en" lang="en">Revisit the exact digits you missed.</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h2>完美一百位</h2><p>100 位全对、无提示、不中断的挑战，可在 Game Center 按用时参加全球排名。</p><p class="en" lang="en">Compete with perfect, uninterrupted runs.</p></article></section><section class="text"><h2>展开，更从容。</h2><p>展开后仍是熟悉的纵向操作：上方数字区，下方键盘。大屏显示更多数字；折叠、旋转或调整窗口时，已输入的数字会保留。</p><h2>专注本身就足够。</h2><p>免费，无广告，无内购。练习离线可用，最近 200 局成绩保存在本机。Game Center 为可选功能，需要网络和 Apple 账户。</p><p class="en" lang="en">Free, without ads or in-app purchases. Offline practice and on-device history. Optional Game Center requires internet access and an Apple account.</p></section>'''))
(out/'privacy').mkdir(exist_ok=True)
(out/'privacy/index.html').write_text(page('π 100 隐私政策','''<article class="text"><span class="eyebrow">PRIVACY · UPDATED 2026-11-08</span><h1>隐私政策</h1><p>π 100 由 Zhu Hong 开发。本政策说明 iOS 应用的数据使用方式。</p><h2>本机数据</h2><p>练习进度、答题记录、最近 200 局成绩和偏好保存在设备上。应用不向开发者的服务器上传这些数据，也不包含广告或第三方分析 SDK。系统备份可能包含应用数据，取决于你的设备备份设置。</p><h2>可选 Game Center</h2><p>你主动连接 Game Center 后，符合规则的完美挑战成绩会提交给 Apple，用于排行榜。Apple 处理 Game Center 账户、玩家昵称和成绩展示；请参阅 <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/game-center/">Apple 的 Game Center 隐私说明</a>。离线成绩可在后续连接时重试。开发者不收集你的 Apple 账户密码或邮箱。</p><h2>删除与控制</h2><p>可在应用“设置”中清除本机进度和成绩。该操作不会删除已提交给 Game Center 的排行榜成绩。你可以在系统设置中管理 Game Center，并联系支持咨询数据问题。</p><h2>网站与支持</h2><p>访问支持网站时，托管服务可能处理正常的请求日志（例如 IP 地址和浏览器信息）。发送支持邮件时，你提供的邮箱和邮件内容仅用于回复和处理问题。无需提供密码或验证码。</p><h2>联系</h2><p>Zhu Hong · <a href="mailto:zivzhu@gmail.com">zivzhu@gmail.com</a></p><hr><h2 lang="en">Privacy policy — English</h2><div lang="en"><p>Pi 100 stores progress, answers, preferences, and the latest 200 rounds on your device. The app does not upload these to a developer-operated server and includes no ads or third-party analytics. Device backups may include app data according to your backup settings.</p><p>When you choose to connect Game Center, eligible perfect challenge times are sent to Apple for leaderboard functionality. Apple manages your Game Center identity, nickname, and displayed scores. Pending offline scores can be retried after connection. We do not collect your Apple account password or email.</p><p>Settings lets you delete local progress and results. This does not remove scores already submitted to Game Center. Manage Game Center through system settings. Website hosting may process standard request logs. Support emails are used to respond to your request. Contact Zhu Hong at zivzhu@gmail.com.</p></div></article>'''))
(out/'support').mkdir(exist_ok=True)
(out/'support/index.html').write_text(page('π 100 支持','''<article class="text"><span class="eyebrow">HERE TO HELP</span><h1>从下一位，继续。</h1><p class="lead">使用中遇到问题？请联系 <a href="mailto:zivzhu@gmail.com?subject=Pi%20100%20Support">zivzhu@gmail.com</a>。</p><details open><summary>如何开始？ / How do I start?</summary><p>选择练习或挑战，点击“开始”，从小数点后的 1、4、1、5、9 开始输入。</p><p lang="en">Choose Practice or Challenge, tap Begin, and enter digits after the decimal point.</p></details><details><summary>为什么成绩没有出现在全球榜？</summary><p>只有挑战模式中 100 位全对、无提示、不中断的成绩可以提交。请在成绩单中连接 Game Center；离线时成绩保存在本机，可点击重试提交。排行榜配置及审核完成后正式开放。</p><p lang="en">Only perfect, uninterrupted Challenge rounds qualify. Connect Game Center in Results, and retry pending submissions when online.</p></details><details><summary>暂停、切换应用或折叠会丢失进度吗？</summary><p>输入会自动保存。离开应用后暂停计时，再打开可继续。已中断的挑战仅计入本机成绩。折叠和窗口尺寸变化保留答题状态。</p><p lang="en">Progress is saved automatically. Leaving the app pauses the timer. Interrupted challenges remain local. Resizing preserves your answers.</p></details><details><summary>如何清除记录？ / How do I clear data?</summary><p>在设置中选择“清除全部本机数据”。这不会删除 Game Center 上的已提交成绩。</p><p lang="en">Use Clear all local data in Settings. This does not delete submitted Game Center scores.</p></details><h2>反馈时请提供</h2><p>设备型号、iOS 版本、应用版本，以及问题发生的步骤。请不要发送密码、验证码或付款信息。</p><p lang="en">Include your device model, iOS version, app version, and steps to reproduce. Never send passwords or verification codes.</p></article>'''))
